{"page":118,"verses":[{"verse_key":"5:58","surah":5,"ayah":58,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا نَادَيْتُمْ إِلَى ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ ٱتَّخَذُوهَا هُزُوًا وَلَعِبًا ۚ ذَٰلِكَ بِأَنَّهُمْ قَوْمٌ لَّا يَعْقِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When you make the call to prayer, they ridicule it and make fun of it: this is because they are people who do not reason.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"5:58"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَادَيْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you make a call","transliteration":"nādaytum","verse_key":"5:58"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"for","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"5:58"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"the prayer","transliteration":"l-ṣalati","verse_key":"5:58"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱتَّخَذُوهَا","en_gloss":"they take it","transliteration":"ittakhadhūhā","verse_key":"5:58"},{"pos":6,"ar":"هُزُوًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) ridicule","transliteration":"huzuwan","verse_key":"5:58"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَعِبًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"and fun","transliteration":"walaʿiban","verse_key":"5:58"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"5:58"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"(is) because they","transliteration":"bi-annahum","verse_key":"5:58"},{"pos":10,"ar":"قَوْمٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) a people","transliteration":"qawmun","verse_key":"5:58"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"(who do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"5:58"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَعْقِلُونَ","en_gloss":"understand","transliteration":"yaʿqilūna","verse_key":"5:58"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٥٨","en_gloss":"(58)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:58"}]},{"verse_key":"5:59","surah":5,"ayah":59,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ يَـٰٓأَهْلَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ هَلْ تَنقِمُونَ مِنَّآ إِلَّآ أَنْ ءَامَنَّا بِٱللَّهِ وَمَآ أُنزِلَ إِلَيْنَا وَمَآ أُنزِلَ مِن قَبْلُ وَأَنَّ أَكْثَرَكُمْ فَـٰسِقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say [Prophet], ‘People of the Book, do you resent us for any reason other than the fact that we believe in God, in what has been sent down to us, and in what was sent before us, while most of you are disobedient?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَهْلَ","en_gloss":"O People","transliteration":"yāahla","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":4,"ar":"هَلْ","en_gloss":"Do","transliteration":"hal","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَنقِمُونَ","en_gloss":"you resent","transliteration":"tanqimūna","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنَّآ","en_gloss":"[of] us","transliteration":"minnā","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَنْ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ءَامَنَّا","en_gloss":"we believe","transliteration":"āmannā","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"has been revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِلَيْنَا","en_gloss":"to us","transliteration":"ilaynā","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"was revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":17,"ar":"قَبْلُ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qablu","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَأَنَّ","en_gloss":"and that","transliteration":"wa-anna","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":19,"ar":"أَكْثَرَكُمْ","en_gloss":"most of you","transliteration":"aktharakum","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":20,"ar":"فَـٰسِقُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) defiantly disobedient","transliteration":"fāsiqūna","verse_key":"5:59"},{"pos":21,"ar":"٥٩","en_gloss":"(59)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:59"}]},{"verse_key":"5:60","surah":5,"ayah":60,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ هَلْ أُنَبِّئُكُم بِشَرٍّ مِّن ذَٰلِكَ مَثُوبَةً عِندَ ٱللَّهِ ۚ مَن لَّعَنَهُ ٱللَّهُ وَغَضِبَ عَلَيْهِ وَجَعَلَ مِنْهُمُ ٱلْقِرَدَةَ وَٱلْخَنَازِيرَ وَعَبَدَ ٱلطَّـٰغُوتَ ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ شَرٌّ مَّكَانًا وَأَضَلُّ عَن سَوَآءِ ٱلسَّبِيلِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say, ‘Shall I tell you who deserves a worse punishment from God than [the one you wish upon] us? Those God distanced from Himself, was angry with, and condemned as apes and pigs, and those who worship idols: they are worse in rank and have strayed further from the right path.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":2,"ar":"هَلْ","en_gloss":"Shall","transliteration":"hal","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أُنَبِّئُكُم","en_gloss":"I inform you","transliteration":"unabbi-ukum","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِشَرٍّۢ","en_gloss":"(of) worse","transliteration":"bisharrin","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"than","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَثُوبَةً","en_gloss":"(as) recompense","transliteration":"mathūbatan","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"Whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَّعَنَهُ","en_gloss":"has (been) cursed","transliteration":"laʿanahu","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَغَضِبَ","en_gloss":"and He became angry","transliteration":"waghaḍiba","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"with him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَجَعَلَ","en_gloss":"and made","transliteration":"wajaʿala","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِنْهُمُ","en_gloss":"of them","transliteration":"min'humu","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْقِرَدَةَ","en_gloss":"[the] apes","transliteration":"l-qiradata","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَٱلْخَنَازِيرَ","en_gloss":"and [the] swines","transliteration":"wal-khanāzīra","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَعَبَدَ","en_gloss":"and (who) worshipped","transliteration":"waʿabada","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ٱلطَّـٰغُوتَ ۚ","en_gloss":"the false deities","transliteration":"l-ṭāghūta","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":21,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":22,"ar":"شَرٌّۭ","en_gloss":"(are) worse","transliteration":"sharrun","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":23,"ar":"مَّكَانًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) position","transliteration":"makānan","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":24,"ar":"وَأَضَلُّ","en_gloss":"and farthest astray","transliteration":"wa-aḍallu","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":25,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":26,"ar":"سَوَآءِ","en_gloss":"(the) even","transliteration":"sawāi","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":27,"ar":"ٱلسَّبِيلِ","en_gloss":"way","transliteration":"l-sabīli","verse_key":"5:60"},{"pos":28,"ar":"٦٠","en_gloss":"(60)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:60"}]},{"verse_key":"5:61","surah":5,"ayah":61,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا جَآءُوكُمْ قَالُوٓا۟ ءَامَنَّا وَقَد دَّخَلُوا۟ بِٱلْكُفْرِ وَهُمْ قَدْ خَرَجُوا۟ بِهِۦ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ أَعْلَمُ بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَكْتُمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When they come to you [believers], they say, ‘We believe,’ but they come disbelieving and leave disbelieving- God knows best what they are hiding.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"5:61"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَآءُوكُمْ","en_gloss":"they come to you","transliteration":"jāūkum","verse_key":"5:61"},{"pos":3,"ar"